      "act": "FRAMEWORK",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Four steps, one pass. First, detect: slate_resolves checks each beat — if media slash BXX dot mp4 already exists, skip it. Second, render: npx remotion render, scale two, CRF sixteen. Third, extend: the last frame freeze-holds to match the measured audio duration. Fourth, stamp: provenance is written back into beat_sheet.json, and the consumer index is updated.",
